# oracle: create_atoms box with lattice points one lamda-epsilon outside the periodic faces (region edges at 0.0000003 and 3.00000003 lattice units): native keeps the lower image (lamda >= -1e-6) and drops the upper one (lamda >= 1 - 2e-6); per-atom positions by ID after run 0
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0.0000003 3.00000003 0 3 0 3
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
pair_style      zero 2.5
pair_coeff      * *
thermo_style    custom step atoms pe
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             0
